(Leonard(on screen):)this is for the invisible kids.

5
00:00:12,626 --> 00:00:15,726
(Leonard(on screen):)Uh, maybe you never fit in.

6
00:00:15,729 --> 00:00:18,259
(Leonard(on screen):)Or maybe you're
the smallest kid in the school,

7
00:00:18,265 --> 00:00:20,495
(Leonard(on screen):)or the heaviest or the weirdest.

8
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:21,600
(Leonard(on screen):)Maybe you're graduating

9
00:00:21,601 --> 00:00:23,901
(Leonard(on screen):)and you still haven't had
