12
00:00:31,143 --> 00:00:33,143
(Leonard(on screen):)Maybe you don't have
any friends.

13
00:00:33,146 --> 00:00:36,016
(Leonard(on screen):)And guess what? That's okay.

14
00:00:36,016 --> 00:00:38,316
(Leonard(on screen):)While all the popular kids
are off doing--

15
00:00:38,318 --> 00:00:40,188
(Leonard(on screen):)whatever, I don't know
what they were doing

16
00:00:40,187 --> 00:00:41,587
(Leonard(on screen):)'cause I was never there...

17
